# IBM Data Analyst Capstone Project – Python Labs

## Overview

This repository contains the Python labs completed as part of the **IBM Data Analyst Capstone Project** on Coursera.

The labs simulate a real-world data analytics workflow—from collecting raw data to cleaning, analyzing, visualizing, and presenting business insights. Throughout the course, I applied industry-standard Python libraries and data analytics techniques to solve practical business problems.

---

## Course Learning Path

### Module 1 – Data Collection
**Topics Covered**
- HTTP Requests
- REST APIs
- JSON Data
- Web Scraping using BeautifulSoup
- HTML Table Extraction
- Exporting data to CSV

**Python Skills**
- requests
- BeautifulSoup
- pandas
- JSON parsing

---

### Module 2 – Data Wrangling
**Topics Covered**
- Finding duplicate records
- Removing duplicates
- Handling missing values
- Data imputation
- Data normalization
- Data cleaning

**Python Skills**
- pandas
- NumPy
- Data preprocessing
- Feature engineering

---

### Module 3 – Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)

**Topics Covered**
- Statistical summaries
- Distribution analysis
- Histograms
- Correlation analysis
- Outlier detection
- Data exploration

**Python Skills**
- pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn

---

### Module 4 – Data Visualization

Implemented multiple visualization techniques including:

- Line Charts
- Bar Charts
- Pie Charts
- Scatter Plots
- Bubble Charts
- Histograms
- Box Plots
- Stacked Charts

Advanced Visualizations

- Interactive Maps using Folium
- Choropleth Maps
- Geographic Data Visualization

Libraries Used

- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Plotly
- Folium

---

### Module 5 – Dashboard Development

Created interactive dashboards using:

- IBM Cognos Analytics
- Google Looker Studio

Dashboard Components included:

- Current Technology Usage
- Future Technology Trends
- Demographics
- Interactive Filters
- KPI Visualizations

---

### Module 6 – Final Project

The capstone project combines all previous modules into a complete analytics workflow.

Deliverables include:

- Data Collection
- Data Cleaning
- Exploratory Data Analysis
- Data Visualization
- Interactive Dashboard
- Business Insights Presentation

---

